    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15 Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-civilian-corps-act-2011#sec-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The regulations may prescribe the Australian Civilian Corps Code\nof Conduct.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531\n\n\nAustralian Civilian Corps  Part 2\n\nSection 16\n\nAustralian Civilian Corps Act 2011\n\n(2) The Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct must include a rule\nthat an Australian Civilian Corps employee must at all times\nbehave in a way that upholds the Australian Civilian Corps Values.\n\n(3) The Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct applies to\nAustralian Civilian Corps employees.",
