      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Act other than this section, the Australian\nCivilian Corps Code of Conduct has effect subject to the\nrestrictions (if any) in directions made under subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Act other than this section, the Australian\nCivilian Corps Code of Conduct has effect subject to the\nrestrictions (if any) in directions made under subsection (1).",
