      "dc:source": "australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Conditions may be attached to payments under this section. If a\ncondition is breached, the payment may be recovered by the\nCommonwealth as a debt in a court of competent jurisdiction.",
