      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, in writing, delegate to:\n\n(a) another Minister; or\n\n(b) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the\nDepartment; or\n\n(c) a person who holds an office or appointment under an Act;\nany or all of his or her powers or functions under this Act or the\nregulations.\nNote:\nThe expressions SES employee and acting SES employee are defined\nin the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.",
