      "dc:source": "australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "Sch 1 (items 1–28): 13\nDec 2013 (s 2)\n—\nPublic Governance,\nPerformance and\nAccountability\n(Consequential and\nTransitional Provisions)\nAct 2014\n62, 2014",
      "skos:definition": "Sch 1 (items 1–28): 13\nDec 2013 (s 2)\n—\nPublic Governance,\nPerformance and\nAccountability\n(Consequential and\nTransitional Provisions)\nAct 2014\n62, 2014",
